====Conjunction====
{{head|ru|conjunction}}

# [[like]] {{gl|in the same manner as / a similar manner to}}; {{n-g|occasionally ''[[as]]''}}
#: {{syn|ru|а́ки<q:archaic>|бу́дто|сло́вно|я́ко<q:dated>}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[она|Она́]] [[вы́глядит]] '''как''' [[знамени́тость]].|She looks '''like''' a celebrity.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[звук|Звук]] «[[г]]», '''как''' [[в]] [[сло́ве]] «good».|The sound "g", '''like'''/'''as''' in the word "good".}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[он|Он]] [[относи́лся]] [[к]] [[э́тому]] '''как''' [[к]] [[рабо́те]].|He treated it '''like'''/'''as''' a job.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[широ́кий]] '''как''' [[мо́ре]]|wide '''like''' the sea / (as) wide '''as''' the sea}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[будьте|Бу́дьте]] '''как''' [[до́ма]].|Make yourself at home.|lit=Be '''like''' at home.}}
# [[as]] {{gl|in the capacity/role of}}
#: {{syn|ru|бу́дучи<qq:about the subject only>|в ка́честве}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[в настоящее время|В настоя́щее вре́мя]] [[дом]] [[функциони́рует]] '''как''' [[музе́й]].|The house now functions '''as''' a museum.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[говорю́]] [[э́то]] '''как''' [[челове́к]], [[кото́рый]] [[хо́чет]] [[помога́ть]] [[други́м]].|I say this '''as''' a man who wants to help others.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[люблю́]] [[её]] '''как''' [[челове́ка]].|I love her '''as''' a person.}}
# [[as]], [[since]] {{gl|because, due to the fact that}}
#: {{syn|ru|так как<qq:more common>}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[и|И]] '''как''' [[он]] [[до́лго]] [[не]] [[приходи́л]], [[обе́дать]] [[ста́ли]] [[без]] [[него́]].|And '''since''' he hadn't arrived for a long time, they began to have lunch without him.}}
# {{lb|ru|when beginning a clause after {{m|ru|[[так]] ([[же]])}} + a [[short form#English:_Q4239848|short-form]] {{lg|adjective}} or {{lg|adverb}}}} [[as]] ({{n-g|introducing an object or scenario of comparison}})
#: {{uxi|ru|[[их|Они́]] [[так]] ([[же]]) [[краси́вы]], '''как''' [[на]] [[фотогра́фиях]].|They're as beautiful '''as''' (they are) on the photos.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[их|Их]] [[не]] [[так]] [[мно́го]], '''как''' [[ка́жется]].|There aren't as many of them '''as''' it seems.}}
# {{lb|ru|when beginning a clause after a {{lg|verb}} or [[short form#English:_Q4239848|short-form]] {{lg|adjective}} + {{m|ru|[[так]] ([[же]])}}}} [[as]] ({{n-g|introducing an object or scenario of comparison; can also be "[[how]]" + {{lg|pronoun}} + {{lg|verb}} in this case, or even just "[[how]]", if a verb and pronoun already exist}})
#: {{uxi|ru|[[они|Она́]] [[звучи́т]] [[так]] ([[же]]), '''как''' [[в]] [[фи́льмах]].|She sounds the same as / like (she does) in the films. / She sounds (like) '''how''' she does in the films.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[они|Они́]] [[расположенный|располо́жены]] [[так]] ([[же]]), '''как''' [[на]] [[схе́ме]].|They are positioned as/like (they are) on the diagram. / They are positioned (like) '''how''' they are on the diagram. / They are positioned (in) the same way '''as''' on the diagram.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[они|Они́]] [[говоря́т]] [[не]] [[так]], '''как''' [[говори́м]] [[мы]].|They don't talk (like) '''how''' we talk. / They don't talk like we talk.}}
# {{n-g|Used to connect a verb of perception (see, hear etc.) with a verb phrase describing an action being perceived. Usually not translated, but can sometimes be translated as "[[how]]". Sometimes, {{m|ru|что}} can be used in place of {{m-self|ru|как}}, but this has a different meaning and is usually translated as "[[that]]".}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[подслу́шал]], '''как''' [[он]] [[говори́л]] [[с]] [[мое́й]] [[сестро́й]].|I overheard him talking to my sister.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[ви́дела]], '''как''' [[она́]] [[ходи́ла]] [[за]] [[ним]] [[в]] [[шко́ле]].|I saw her following him around in school.|lit=I saw '''how''' she was following him around in school.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[по́мню]], '''как''' [[она́]] [[пла́кала]] [[в]] [[раздева́лке]].|I remember her crying in the changing room.|lit=I remember '''how''' she was crying in the changing room.}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial|between a duplicated noun}} {{n-g|Used to emphasise the insignificance of something, that something isn't special.}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[в|В]] [[рука́х]] Мо́ны Ли́зы [[нет]] [[ничего́]] [[необычный|необы́чного]]. [[руки|Ру́ки]] '''как''' [[ру́ки]].|There's nothing unusual about the Mona Lisa's hands. They're just hands.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[пацан|Паца́н]] '''как''' [[паца́н]], [[норма́льный]] [[ма́льчик]].|He's just a guy, a normal boy.}}
# {{lb|ru|with a negative or [[interrogative#English|interrogative]]}} [[except]], [[besides]], [[other than]]
#: {{syn|ru|кро́ме}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[больше|Бо́льше]] [[не́кому]], '''как''' [[тебе́]].|There's no one '''but''' you.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[кто|Кто]], '''как''' [[не]] [[мы]]?|Who else, '''if not''' us?}}

